            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Having `/home/user/.config/repro/init.lua` opened, cursor on line 3. The winid is 1000.\n\nNow, on the commandline, type: `:lua vim.api.nvim_win_call(1000, function() vim.cmd(\"edit /home/user/.config/repro\") vim.print(vim.api.nvim_win_get_cursor(1000) end)`\n\nResult: Mini.files pops up and a message appears: `{1, 0}`\n\nNow switch the statements inside the function: `:lua vim.print(vim.api.nvim_win_get_cursor(1000) vim.api.nvim_win_call(1000, function() vim.cmd(\"edit /home/user/.config/repro\") end)`\n\nResult: Mini.files pops up and a message appears: `{3, 0}`\n\nApparantly, the `edit` inside `vim.api.nvim_win_call` resets the cursor to `{1, 0}`...\n",
